        <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
          <name>MessageInfoEmail</name>
          <id>209</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000>From January 1, 2021, users who migrate from UTII to GTS can have the same taxation system &lt;/>&lt;/>
&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000> in the cash register settings if they use a fiscal memory device that is valid for 36 months &lt;/>&lt;/>
&lt;link https://its.1c.ru/bmk/envd_kkt>&lt;u>&lt;font Arial>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #3541EB>&lt;bgcolor #FFFFFF>For more information, see&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000>Letter of the Federal Tax Service of Russia of December 3, 2020 No. AB-4-20/19907@.&lt;/>&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000>از 1 ژانویه 2021، کاربرانی که از UTII به GTS منتقل می‌شوند می‌توانند همان سیستم مالیاتی را &lt;/>&lt;/>
&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000> در تنظیمات صندوق فروش داشته باشند، در صورتی که از حافظه مالیاتی با اعتبار 36 ماهه استفاده کنند &lt;/>&lt;/>
&lt;link https://its.1c.ru/bmk/envd_kkt>&lt;u>&lt;font Arial>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #3541EB>&lt;bgcolor #FFFFFF>برای اطلاعات بیشتر، ببینید&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000> نامه سازمان مالیاتی فدرال روسیه مورخ 3 دسامبر 2020 شماره AB-4-20/19907@.&lt;/>&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000>Пользователи, переходящие с 01.01.2021 с ЕНВД на ОСН, могут не менять систему налогообложения &lt;/>&lt;/>
&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000>в настройках кассы, если используют фискальный накопитель со сроком действия 36 мес. &lt;/>&lt;/>
&lt;link https://its.1c.ru/bmk/envd_kkt>&lt;u>&lt;font Arial>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #3541EB>&lt;bgcolor #FFFFFF>Подробнее см.&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000> Письмо ФНС России от 03.12.2020 № АБ-4-20/19907@.&lt;/>&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000>01/01/2021 tarihinden Potansiyel Gelir üzerine Tek Vergiden Ana Vergilendirme Sistemi geçiş yapan kullanıcılar, 36 ay geçerlilik süresi olan bir mali biriktirici kullanıyorsa, yazar kasa ayarlarında vergilendirme&lt;/>&lt;/>
&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000> sistemini değiştirmeye bilirler.&lt;/>&lt;/>
&lt;link https://its.1c.ru/bmk/envd_kkt>&lt;u>&lt;font Arial>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #3541EB>&lt;bgcolor #FFFFFF>Daha fazla ayrıntı için bkz.&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000> 3 Aralık 2020 tarihli Rusya Federal Vergi Hizmeti Mektubu No. AB-4-20/19907@.&lt;/>&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000>Người sử dụng chuyển từ Hệ thống thuế khoán sang Hệ thống thuế chung từ 01.01.2021 có thể không áp dụng hệ thống thuế &lt;/>&lt;/>
&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000>trong tùy chỉnh quỹ tiền mặt, nếu sử dụng bộ nhớ máy tính tiền với thời hạn hiệu lực 36 tháng. &lt;/>&lt;/>
&lt;link https://its.1c.ru/bmk/envd_kkt>&lt;u>&lt;font Arial>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #3541EB>&lt;bgcolor #FFFFFF>Chi tiết xem&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000> Công văn của Tổng cục thuế.&lt;/>&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000>From January 1, 2021, users who migrate from UTII to GTS can have the same taxation system &lt;/>&lt;/>
&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000> in the cash register settings if they use a fiscal memory device that is valid for 36 months &lt;/>&lt;/>
&lt;link https://its.1c.ru/bmk/envd_kkt>&lt;u>&lt;font Arial>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #3541EB>&lt;bgcolor #FFFFFF>For more information, see&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000>Letter of the Federal Tax Service of Russia of December 3, 2020 No. AB-4-20/19907@.&lt;/>&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000>From January 1, 2021, users who migrate from UTII to GTS can have the same taxation system &lt;/>&lt;/>
&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000> in the cash register settings if they use a fiscal memory device that is valid for 36 months &lt;/>&lt;/>
&lt;link https://its.1c.ru/bmk/envd_kkt>&lt;u>&lt;font Arial>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #3541EB>&lt;bgcolor #FFFFFF>For more information, see&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 10>&lt;color #000000>Letter of the Federal Tax Service of Russia of December 3, 2020 No. AB-4-20/19907@.&lt;/>&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <enabled>true</enabled>
          <userVisible>
            <common>true</common>
          </userVisible>
